{
  "name": "Send order status updates with WhatsApp templates and track delivery",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "19e6ac22-117e-430f-ac75-ea5a54a85614",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Order status updates via WhatsApp templates, with delivery log\n\nSends the right approved template when an order changes status and records whether it was delivered or read.\n\n### How it works\n1. Your shop or backend POSTs {order_id, status, phone, name, tracking_url} to the webhook.\n2. A Code node picks the template for the status (confirmed, shipped, delivered).\n3. The WhatsApp node sends the template; the message id is logged in Google Sheets.\n4. A second branch listens to WhatsApp status webhooks (sent, delivered, read, failed) and updates the log row.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Create three templates named order_confirmed, order_shipped, order_delivered, each with two body variables (name, order id), and wait for approval. Names can be changed in the Code node.\n2. Sheet tab \"Order messages\": order_id, status, phone, message_id, delivery_status, updated_at, error.\n3. Add credentials: WhatsApp Business Cloud, WhatsApp Trigger, Google Sheets. Set your phone number id and spreadsheet.\n4. Call the webhook Production URL from your shop.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "29a13696-9f1f-4fe4-9008-ecbe512a535f",
      "name": "Meta rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Meta rules to know\n- Order updates usually go out outside a 24 hour window, so they **must be approved templates**. Only send to customers who gave **opt-in** for order updates.\n- Meta decides the category. Order, shipping and delivery updates are normally utility. Promotion inside them can get a template recategorised as marketing, which is billed higher.\n- Template variables cannot be empty.\n- A failed status carries an error code; review failed rows rather than retrying blindly.\n- Cost is per delivered template message, by recipient country and category.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a744d4ce-9528-4de5-9ef9-f2233562a261",
      "name": "Section: send",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Send the template",
        "height": 60,
        "width": 1580
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4cbda961-ed53-462c-8054-d40023f08e3a",
      "name": "Order webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        120
      ],
      "webhookId": "4eb8609d-8c7c-44fd-994e-676c29ea0992",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-order-status",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "25b800f3-7b7c-4e62-87b5-eb6d709a26ac",
      "name": "Pick template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        200,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Expects: { order_id, status: confirmed|shipped|delivered, phone, name, lang }\nconst b = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nconst templates = { confirmed: 'order_confirmed', shipped: 'order_shipped', delivered: 'order_delivered' };\nconst status = String(b.status || '').toLowerCase();\nconst phone = String(b.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\nconst lang = b.lang || 'en';\nif (!templates[status] || phone.length < 8 || !b.order_id) {\n  return [{ json: { ok: false, error: 'Unknown status, missing order_id or invalid phone' } }];\n}\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ok: true, order_id: String(b.order_id), status, phone,\n  template: templates[status] + '|' + lang,\n  name: String(b.name || 'there').trim(),\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2c05c626-c305-4d09-944d-fdd33373cd48",
      "name": "Valid event?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6172e6d9-4798-4136-89b9-602b642e3ab9",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "415bdd46-d7f1-4151-a0f9-70d2181ac77a",
      "name": "Send order template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        680,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "operation": "sendTemplate",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $json.phone }}",
        "template": "={{ $json.template }}",
        "components": {
          "component": [
            {
              "type": "body",
              "bodyParameters": {
                "parameter": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "={{ $json.name }}"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "={{ $json.order_id }}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ac597078-7043-445f-a1b0-c8aaca5321d4",
      "name": "Build log row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        920,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const src = $('Pick template').first().json;\nconst res = $input.first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  order_id: src.order_id, status: src.status, phone: src.phone,\n  message_id: res.messages?.[0]?.id || '',\n  delivery_status: 'accepted', error: '', updated_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1648ef70-d08e-430c-bb30-36e4e1ca7e96",
      "name": "Log message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1160,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Order messages",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "24d2cca8-3324-43f1-bca8-191b0cfb4a52",
      "name": "Respond OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        1400,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"ok\": true } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "37e2738b-5a54-4d17-9f44-0ce4cf45a634",
      "name": "Respond error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        680,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"ok\": false, \"error\": $json.error } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4029ecb5-540c-4018-9478-2c9ff8b0efc8",
      "name": "Section: status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Track delivery status",
        "height": 60,
        "width": 1580
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dccfe81f-ac24-4781-a17c-1fdca0e85325",
      "name": "WhatsApp status trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        540
      ],
      "webhookId": "e67485dc-b513-449e-8a30-a970a90aaa62",
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ],
        "options": {
          "messageStatusUpdates": [
            "sent",
            "delivered",
            "read",
            "failed"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33782ee8-3c39-45ee-89bf-1fb05bcde666",
      "name": "Is status update?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "240fa800-d91e-4b85-a770-b5fcb3f682e9",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!$json.statuses }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7bf54202-0019-4415-95b6-f73edff59719",
      "name": "Map status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const s = $input.first().json.statuses[0];\nreturn [{ json: {\n  message_id: s.id,\n  delivery_status: s.status, // sent | delivered | read | failed\n  error: s.errors?.[0] ? s.errors[0].code + ' ' + (s.errors[0].title || '') : '',\n  updated_at: new Date(Number(s.timestamp) * 1000).toISOString(),\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "29e43ded-52b3-4c32-bd7b-295da383c986",
      "name": "Update log row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        720,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Order messages",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [
            "message_id"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
